# Hex words that scripts/lint-upstream-cite must not read as an upstream Gliff
# revision. One word per line, then a reason. A Gliff revision never goes here:
# cite the revision pinned in Cargo.toml instead.
ed25519 an ssh key type
a0010409 a Windows keyboard layout id
312473c6d8761351a74f27af1fd5c621d3a58a96 a commit of this repository
1839f39 a commit of this repository
